WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
BUILD 062. A TRANSCRIPT IS NOT THE WHOLE INTERVIEW.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
PRESERVE PASSAGES, ASSERTIONS, SOURCES, LABELS, TIMESTAMPS, PROVENANCE, AND MISSING MATERIAL.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
CONNECT EACH ASSERTION TO ITS EXACT PASSAGE AND DECLARED SOURCE.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
KEEP SUPPORT, CONTRADICTION, UNKNOWN STATE, AND FOLLOW-UP QUESTIONS DISTINCT.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
A NETWORK CANNOT VERIFY IDENTITY, TRUTH, CONSENT, CREDIBILITY, OR COMPLETENESS.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
KEEP THE SOURCE ATTACHED. MAKE EVERY CONFLICT AND FOLLOW-UP REVIEWABLE.
